# Static-asset redirects. Netlify-format; Cloudflare Pages reads this too.
# BunnyCDN needs an equivalent edge rule (deploy step translates this file).
#
# Three redirect shapes:
#   1. Bare root → /en/ default locale landing
#   2. Legacy locale shortcuts (/zh, /zh-cn) → modern zh-hant / zh-hans
#   3. Unprefixed static assets (/llms.txt, /openapi.json) → EN locale variants
#
# Other path-redirects (e.g. 1016 unit-pair URLs) are NOT enumerated here:
# v0.3 has no SEO traffic, so Google's index is empty. For future-proofing,
# a 404.astro page at root performs a client-side redirect to the EN
# equivalent (see src/pages/404.astro).

# Bare root → default locale landing
/  /en/  301

# Convention path /sitemap.xml → real sitemap index
# (otherwise 404.astro returns SPA HTML; crawlers expecting /sitemap.xml get nothing parseable)
/sitemap.xml  /sitemap-index.xml  302

# Legacy locale shortcuts → modern names
/zh  /zh-hant/  301
/zh-cn  /zh-hans/  301
/zh-CN  /zh-hans/  301

# Unprefixed static assets (/llms.txt, /openapi.json) are served directly
# from public/llms.txt and public/openapi.json — no redirect needed.
